# Envoy of Okinec Ahau: "{4}{W}: Create a 1/1 colorless Gnome artifact creature token." On turn 1 Bot1 casts the Envoy with
# Mox Pearl, Mox Ruby and Mox Jet. On turn 3 its four moxen make four mana, one short, so the activation is refused until
# Mox Emerald is cast and tapped: five mana pay exactly and leave the pool empty. Each activation makes one Gnome, a 1/1
# colorless artifact creature under Bot1's control (CR 111.1), and Bot2 gets nothing. On turn 5 Mox Pearl pays for a second
# Envoy, and the five mana that remain (Sapphire, Emerald and three red from Black Lotus) cannot pay {W}: no white (CR 107.4).

